    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1140508135",
      "Source": "ECORE Tip- General Advice",
      "Trans": {"SC":"灭绝核心提示 - 通用建议","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2075370563",
      "Source": "-Tame all the Prime dinos if you can, as they are easier to spot<#RN#>the way you obtain them is the normal manner you would with a vanilla counterpart.<#RN#><#RN#>-Start a farm when you can,get bee hives too for honey as you will need it. <#RN#><#RN#>-Start making regular kibble, so that you can THEN make Alpha Kibble for the respected Alpha dinos.<#RN#>or example; if wanted to tame a Alpha Raptor, you would need Alpha Simple Kibble, just like how a vanilla raptor would want Simple Kibble Regularly.<#RN#><#RN#>-Get a ocean/water creature as you will want to get bio toxin for the opiates or sedatives for when you can start getting Alphas whenever that may be.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"-尽量驯服所有究极恐龙, 它们更容易被发现<#RN#>服方式与原版普通恐龙一致.<#RN#><#RN#>-尽早建造养殖场,同时搭建蜂箱收集蜂蜜，后续玩法会用到. <#RN#><#RN#>-先制作普通饲料,之后才能制作对应精英恐龙的精英饲料.<#RN#>举例：想要驯服精英迅猛龙，需要精英简易饲料，就像原版迅猛龙只吃普通简易饲料一样.<#RN#><#RN#>-驯养一只海洋水生生物，用来获取生物毒素制作麻醉药剂，以备后续驯服各类精英恐龙.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2349628631",
      "Source": "Extinction Core Welcome!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"欢迎来到灭绝核心！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1537363344",
      "Source": "Extinction Core Ascended can be a brutal mod when played alone or with friends, friends would make it easier! <#RN#>Regardless, once you get the hang of it, <#RN#>Extinction Core Ascended can be a rewarding an fun.<#RN#>As you play,if wanting a nice guide. please look in your engrams for 'ECORE'<#RN#>Depending where you are in the mod. You will see respected notes about the mod that you can read if wish too.<#RN#><#RN#>But given you are reading this, how you should start playing this mod is play it as if was in normal vanilla ark.<#RN#>Thats the base general advice I will give,dont think you need to jump to a tier.<#RN#>Get Resources, a base, vanilla dinos to help, better tools for the upcoming tiers you will try to get into.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"灭绝核心飞升模组无论单人还是联机游玩都有一定难度，和好友一起玩会轻松很多! <#RN#>即便如此，只要熟悉玩法后, <#RN#>游玩灭绝核心飞升模组会极具乐趣与成就感.<#RN#>游玩过程中如果需要攻略指引，可在技能蓝图中查找「ECORE」相关内容<#RN#>根据你在模组中的游玩进度，可查看对应的模组说明笔记自行阅读.<#RN#><#RN#>既然你已看到本提示，游玩该模组的正确开局方式是：按照方舟原版常规玩法起步.<#RN#>这是基础入门建议，不要一开始就急于挑战高阶层级内容.<#RN#>先收集资源、建造基地、驯养原版恐龙辅助生存，制作更好的工具，为后续挑战高阶层级做好准备.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1467342856",
      "Source": "The Endgame Boss Page",
      "Trans": {"SC":"终局 BOSS 说明页","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1736865250",
      "Source": "This is the Final fight, Once you call upon him. The fight commences. He will stay on the ark for 60 minutes. I would recommend, Fully leveled,Improved saddles. Do not be surprised when near its death it does something not expecting it to do. It is The One Being afterall. ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这是终极之战，一旦召唤 BOSS，战斗即刻开始. BOSS 会在方舟世界留存 60 分钟. 建议角色满级、装备优质进阶鞍具再前去挑战. BOSS 濒死时会释放意想不到的特殊能力，请不必意外. 毕竟它是独一无二的至高存在. ","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2461619882",
      "Source": "Extinction Core Tiers",
      "Trans": {"SC":"灭绝核心 等级层级","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3284878918",
      "Source": "There is 13 tiers in this mod. Only 6 of them are tameable/Obtainable.<#RN#>The list is.<#RN#>Prime<#RN#>Tribesmen<#RN#>Vanilla Core<#RN#>Alpha<#RN#>Tameable Boss's<#RN#>Primordials<#RN#><#RN#>The Ones cannot get are.<#RN#>Skeletal/Nightmare Skeletal<#RN#>Apex<#RN#>Pygmys<#RN#>Scions<#RN#>Primal Teks<#RN#>Guardian Deitys<#RN#>Absolute Deitys<#RN#>The One Being",
      "Trans": {"SC":"本模组共有 13 个阶级，其中仅有 6 个可以驯服 / 获取.<#RN#>列表如下.<#RN#>究极级<#RN#>部落级<#RN#>原版核心级<#RN#>精英级<#RN#>可驯服的BOSS级 <#RN#>原始级<#RN#><#RN#>以下为无法获取的阶级.<#RN#>骨架级 / 噩梦骨架级<#RN#>顶尖级<#RN#>侏儒级<#RN#>后裔级<#RN#>原始泰克级<#RN#>守护神祇级<#RN#>至高神祇级<#RN#>永恒真神","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3010756539",
      "Source": "ECORE Page- Absolute Deity Tier",
      "Trans": {"SC":"灭绝核心页面 - 至高神祇阶级","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::857623405",
      "Source": "Absolute Deitys: These are the second to last tier of Cosmic bosses before you Challenge The One Being. Prepare for a tough fight, as there projectile attacks are unpredictable and do alot of damage when hit by it. I would recommend having mastered the technique of applying vials or items to your dino when facing these. Summoned only, they will only stay on the Ark for 30 minutes before vanishing",
      "Trans": {"SC":"神祇级：这是挑战永恒真神存在之前的倒数第二级 BOSS. 请做好苦战准备，它们的远程攻击难以预判，命中后会造成高额伤害. 挑战这类 BOSS 时，建议熟练掌握给恐龙使用药剂或道具的操作技巧. 仅可通过召唤出现，它们只会在方舟世界停留 30 分钟，随后便会消失","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1500371465",
      "Source": "ECORE Page- Alpha Tier",
      "Trans": {"SC":"灭绝核心页面 - 精英阶级","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2760992523",
      "Source": "Alphas: Ark player’s that have played longer than 20 hours of the game<#RN#>You’ve likely encountered the alpha dinos Ark has now, raptor,carno,rex etc.<#RN#>They are strong, have way more health and faster than vanilla dinos. <#RN#>There are now Alpha variants of most dinos. <#RN#>Good amount do special additional things.<#RN#><#RN#>You can tame and breed them. Give loot upon killing and resources required for the mod at some point.<#RN#>How you tame them is to give them the respected kibble they want. <#RN#>For example, an Alpha Raptor will want an Alpha Simple Kibble, much like how a normal raptor wants Simple Kibble. <#RN#>There are only a few selected Alphas that require different taming methods.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"精英级生物：游玩方舟超过 20 小时的玩家都有所了解<#RN#>你大概率遇见过方舟原版的精英恐龙，如精英迅猛龙、精英牛龙、精英霸王龙等.<#RN#>它们实力强悍，生命值远高于普通原版恐龙且移动速度更快. <#RN#>如今模组内大多数恐龙都有精英变种. <#RN#>不少精英恐龙还拥有额外特殊能力.<#RN#><#RN#>可以驯服并繁殖它们；击杀后会掉落战利品以及模组后期所需资源.<#RN#>驯服方式为投喂对应专属饲料. <#RN#>举例：精英迅猛龙需要精英简易饲料，就像普通迅猛龙只吃简易饲料一样. <#RN#>仅有少数特定精英恐龙需要特殊驯服方式.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2493633543",
      "Source": "ECORE Tip- Alpha Eggs",
      "Trans": {"SC":" 灭绝核心提示 - 精英龙蛋","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3741933442",
      "Source": "Alpha Egg farming Tip<#RN#>I would have a oviraptor or a mod that would give the boost laying egg buff <#RN#>(the one they're the egg icon is above the Dino's)<#RN#>Also to have atleast two females an one male.<#RN#><#RN#>Fertilized Eggs DO NOT COUNT.<#RN#><#RN#>If wanting to mess with the egg laying multiplier ini setting. <#RN#>You actually decrease the number to increase the egg laying speed.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"精英龙蛋繁育技巧<#RN#>建议准备一只窃蛋龙，或使用能提供产蛋增益效果的模组 <#RN#>(就是恐龙头顶会出现蛋图标的那种增益)<#RN#>同时至少准备两只雌性恐龙和一只雄性恐龙.<#RN#><#RN#>受精蛋不计入（产蛋效率）统计.<#RN#><#RN#>如果你想修改配置文件里的产蛋倍率参数. <#RN#>实际规则是：数值调小，产蛋速度反而变快.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::445881052",
      "Source": "ECORE Page- Apex Tier",
      "Trans": {"SC":"灭绝核心页面 - 顶尖阶级","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4157857928",
      "Source": "Apex’s: Very few dinos are in this tier, the earlier ones like the Apex Raptor is a good test to test your strength.<#RN#>When should you face them? I would say when have a decent Alpha Dino of the superior kibble level or lower if have higher saddle quailty.<#RN#>Once you take the raptor on the Carno And Allo will be somewhat of the strength level of Scions. <#RN#>Tread Carefully. As the ones like Apex Rex will be hitting hard.<#RN#>Upon Killing them they will give good loot.<#RN#>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"顶尖级：该阶级的恐龙数量很少，前期的顶尖迅猛龙很适合用来检验自身实力.<#RN#>什么时候可以挑战它们？建议拥有高阶饲料等级的优质精英恐龙再去；若拥有高品质鞍具，门槛可以适当降低.<#RN#>当你能轻松打过顶尖迅猛龙后，顶尖牛龙与顶尖异特龙的实力就接近后裔级生物了. <#RN#>务必小心谨慎，像顶尖霸王龙这类生物的攻击伤害极高.<#RN#>击杀它们后可以获得丰厚战利品.<#RN#>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2914551270",
      "Source": "ECORE Page- Tameable Boss Tier",
      "Trans": {"SC":"灭绝核心页面 - 可驯服 BOSS 阶级","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1158610124",
      "Source": "ECORE Tip- Evolution",
      "Trans": {"SC":"灭绝核心提示 - 进化系统","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::537927993",
      "Source": "These dinos in order to obtain must be evolved from a previous dino that you have.<#RN#><#RN#>Alpha Reaper:<#RN#>Must have a Vanilla Reaper King from MY Reaper Queens<#RN#>You will know it is mine if it has a crafting slot in its Inventory<#RN#>It will then proceed to show you how to obtain a Alpha Reaper<#RN#><#RN#>Supremes:<#RN#>In order to Get these Blood Thirsty Primordial Dinos,You must defeat one first.<#RN#>Once you do not only do you unlock the engrams associated with it.<#RN#>It will give you the Supreme Soul that corresponds with the Supreme trying to get.<#RN#>Then check the Inventory of the respected Alpha dinos.<#RN#>So far the Supremes you can get. Supreme Reaper,Supreme Rex,Supreme Trike,Supreme Deinotherium<#RN#>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"想要获得这些恐龙，必须由你已拥有的前一阶恐龙进化而来.<#RN#><#RN#>精英死神：<#RN#>必须拥有由本模组死神女王所产下的原版死神国王<#RN#>背包里带有制作栏位的，就是本模组的死神国王<#RN#>之后会指引你如何进化获得精英死神<#RN#><#RN#>至高霸主级:<#RN#>想要获得这些嗜血的远古本源恐龙，必须先击杀一只对应个体.<#RN#>击杀后不仅会解锁对应的技能蓝图.<#RN#>还会掉落与该至高霸主对应的至高之魂.<#RN#>随后前往对应精英恐龙的背包中进行操作即可进化.<#RN#>目前可获取的至高霸主有：至高死神、至高霸王龙、至高三角龙、至高恐象<#RN#>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3329805773",
      "Source": "ECORE Page- Guardian Deity Tier",
      "Trans": {"SC":"灭绝核心页面 - 守护神祇阶级","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2839983207",
      "Source": "Guardian Golem Deities: Challenged by the strongest Survivors.<#RN#>These World Bosses will require strong tactics,extensive preparation and determination in order to achieve victory! <#RN#>It is highly advised to have as much vials an detox’s as you can. <#RN#>You must kill the minions when summoned,as the Guardian Golem will just be Immune to any damage done to it.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"守护神祇：仅有最强的幸存者才可向其发起挑战.<#RN#>挑战这些世界 BOSS 需要精妙战术、充足准备以及坚定意志才能取得胜利! <#RN#>强烈建议尽可能多准备各类药剂与解毒剂. <#RN#>BOSS 召唤小怪时必须优先清掉爪牙，否则魔像守护者将会处于完全免伤状态.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3472006849",
      "Source": "ECORE Tip- Lay Egg Taming",
      "Trans": {"SC":"灭绝核心提示 - 驯服下蛋法","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3320049474",
      "Source": "[Lower Health Egg Mechanic] <#RN#><#RN#>These Dinos if female, when you get them low to health will drop a egg before it is killed.<#RN#>The Dinos are the following.<#RN#><#RN#>Wyverns,Alpha Wyverns, Alpha Faslo,Stellar Faslo,Stellar Giga,Stellar Thyla,Stellar Spino<#RN#>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"[低血量产蛋机制] <#RN#><#RN#>以下雌性恐龙在血量被压低后，会在被击杀前产下一枚蛋.<#RN#>可触发该机制的恐龙如下.<#RN#><#RN#>双足飞龙,精英双足飞龙, 精英法索拉鳄,星耀法索拉鳄,星耀南巨,星耀袋狮,星耀棘背龙<#RN#>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2008581281",
      "Source": "ECORE Page- Omega Tier",
      "Trans": {"SC":"灭绝核心页面 - 欧米伽阶级","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1042781635",
      "Source": "Omegas: Omegas drop Amulets used to craft Primordial Tributes depending on the tribute you are trying to make.<#RN#>You will need a Amulet from an Omega boss to craft the tribute. <#RN#>Omegas are stronger,faster,harder hitting than their normal counterparts. <#RN#>Only can Successfully be killed from a Boss tame WITH a Improved Saddle equipped.<#RN#>If you do not do this, it will reflect the damage back at you.<#RN#>Improved Saddle BP’s will drop a good percentage from the respected boss. <#RN#>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"欧米伽级生物：击杀欧米伽生物会掉落护符，可用来制作对应的原始献祭贡品.<#RN#>制作献祭贡品必须使用欧米伽 BOSS 掉落的护符. <#RN#>欧米伽生物比普通同类型生物更强、速度更快、攻击伤害更高. <#RN#>只有骑乘已驯服 BOSS 并装备改良鞍具，才能成功击杀它们.<#RN#>不满足该条件的话，受到的攻击伤害将会被反弹给自己.<#RN#>对应 BOSS 有较高概率掉落改良鞍具蓝图. <#RN#>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3448920297",
      "Source": "ECORE Page- Primal Tek Tier",
      "Trans": {"SC":"灭绝核心页面 - 原始泰克阶级","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1432233491",
      "Source": "Primal Tek Dinos: After Defeating The Guardian Deity’s is when you would safely be able to target these Dinos. <#RN#>They will provide efficient resources that will start needing for the later grind of the mod. <#RN#>The more you climb to face the stronger Primal Tek Dino’s the harder it will be. <#RN#>Along with the Tek Defense Units they summon.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"原始泰克恐龙：击败守护神祇后，你才有实力稳妥地挑战这类恐龙. <#RN#>它们会产出高效资源，是模组后期刷取流程所需的关键物资. <#RN#>你越是挑战高阶更强的原始泰克恐龙，难度也会随之大幅提升. <#RN#>它们还会召唤泰克防御单位一同作战.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2221703748",
      "Source": "ECORE Note- Prime Tier",
      "Trans": {"SC":"灭绝核心注解 - 究极阶级","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::283147842",
      "Source": "Prime: Some creatures will have a prime version which is a step between traditional ark creatures<#RN#>that seem ‘low’ on the totem pole. <#RN#>Like a Otter,Dodo etc. They are similar to their normal counterparts but different in some ways. <#RN#>Some produce stuff when left on wander, or enhance what they can do. <#RN#>Taming them follows mostly the same rules as normal ones, Prime Otter drag fish to it, Prime Dodo knock that bird out!<#RN#><#RN#>Prime Dodo- Dodo's that will fight back if confronted. They gain a pack buff much. Nice berry gather for a start<#RN#>Prime Otter- When on wander, will generate silica pearls an black pearls<#RN#>Prime Dimporh- Decent Flyer with no saddle needed, can shoot off of them.<#RN#>Prime Snail- Generates Cementing paste an Hard Polymer.<#RN#>Prime Titanboa- This Titanboa is a tame that will knock out alot of Dino's with its venomous bite.<#RN#>on wander produces Narcotic an Titanboa Venom.<#RN#>Prime Dung- Produces Fertilizer and Oil on wander<#RN#>Prime Featherlight- Good flyer with no need for saddle",
      "Trans": {"SC":"究极级：部分生物拥有究极变种，介于方舟普通原版生物层级之间<#RN#>属于基础弱势梯队的生物进阶形态. <#RN#>例如水獭、渡渡鸟等；外形与普通个体相近，但部分特性有所差异. <#RN#>部分究极生物开启巡逻模式后可自动产出物资，或是强化自身能力. <#RN#>驯服方式大体和普通生物一致：究极水獭投喂鱼肉，究极渡渡鸟直接打晕驯服!<#RN#><#RN#>究极渡渡鸟 — 遭遇敌人时会主动反击，拥有极强群体增益效果，前期采集浆果非常实用<#RN#>究极水獭 — 开启巡逻模式后，可自动产出含硅珍珠与黑珍珠<#RN#>究极双型齿翼龙 — 不错的飞行生物，无需鞍具即可骑乘，骑乘时可以开火射击.<#RN#>究极蜗牛 — 可自动产出水泥与聚合物.<#RN#>究极泰坦巨蟒 — 驯服后可依靠毒液咬伤眩晕大量恐龙.<#RN#>开启巡逻模式可自动产出麻醉药与泰坦巨蟒毒液.<#RN#>究极蜣螂 — 巡逻状态下产出肥料与石油<#RN#>究极轻羽鸟 — 性能优秀的飞行生物，无需鞍具即可骑乘","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::891325181",
      "Source": "ECORE Notes- Primordial Tier",
      "Trans": {"SC":"灭绝核心注解 - 原始阶级","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4071522411",
      "Source": "Primordial creatures are not like the other Extinction Core Ascended creatures that you have tamed in the wild.<#RN#>Tribute ones are made by killing a Deity and Unlocking a Tribute. Making a primordial matrix and then crafting the tribute with all the required items.<#RN#><#RN#>But that isn't the only way to get your own primordial. <#RN#>You may have seen two type of primordials in the wild. <#RN#>Beast of Darkness,Ultimate,Supreme dino or Stellar Dino.<#RN#><#RN#>Search the pages for information regarding a specefic Primordial wondering about<#RN#><#RN#>You can approach this method in ANY fashion AFTER you obtain one of the Tribute Primordials.<#RN#>Like Bokito, Silitha or Horvath. You can honestly take these Primordials’ to the end game if you wish.<#RN#><#RN#>I made all these options to get for people who might see the other options more than the others do to just pure RNG luck or bad luck. <#RN#>For example they might see Ultimate’s more then they would Supremes. <#RN#>Another they might see more Stellar’s and like the idea of breeding them to be absolute monsters.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"原始生物不同于你在野外驯服的其他灭绝核心飞升级生物.<#RN#>贡品召唤型原始生物需要先击杀神祇解锁贡品配方，制作原始阵列，再集齐所有所需材料合成贡品.<#RN#><#RN#>但这并不是获取原始生物的唯一途径. <#RN#>你可能在野外见过两种原始生物. <#RN#>黑暗之魂,终极霸主,至高生物或星耀生物.<#RN#><#RN#>若想了解某一种特定原始生物的详情，可查阅对应介绍页面<#RN#><#RN#>只要你拥有任意一只贡品召唤型原始生物，就可以用任意方式解锁后续玩法.<#RN#>例如博基托、西莉萨、霍瓦斯这类原始生物，你完全可以一直用到游戏后期毕业.<#RN#><#RN#>我设计多种获取途径，是为了照顾运气好坏不同的玩家，避免只靠随机概率卡进度. <#RN#>比如有的玩家更容易刷出终极级生物，而非至高级. <#RN#>也有玩家经常遇到星耀级生物，可以通过繁育把它们培养成极强的战力单位.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3400851893",
      "Source": "Buffed Scion Of Nature Bear",
      "Trans": {"SC":"强化自然恐熊后裔","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":true,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3490030294",
      "Source": "Buffed Scion Of Fire Sabertooth",
      "Trans": {"SC":"强化火焰刃齿虎后裔","JA":"强化火焰劍齿虎后裔"},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":true,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1043910444",
      "Source": "Buffed Scion Of Winter Mammoth",
      "Trans": {"SC":"强化寒冬猛犸象后裔","JA":"强化寒冬猛獁象后裔"},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":true,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2783165871",
      "Source": "Mercenary Argentavis",
      "Trans": {"SC":"佣兵-阿根廷鹫","JA":"佣兵-阿根廷鷲"},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":true,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2797683351",
      "Source": "Mastercraft Merchant",
      "Trans": {"SC":"精工级商人","JA":"精工級商人"},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":true,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3458244581",
      "Source": "Apprentice Merchant",
      "Trans": {"SC":"学徒级商人","JA":"学徒級商人"},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":true,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1116205368",
      "Source": "Ascendant Merchant",
      "Trans": {"SC":"飞升级商人","JA":"飞升級商人"},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":true,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::858381378",
      "Source": "Mercenary Giga",
      "Trans": {"SC":"佣兵-南方巨兽龙","JA":"佣兵-南方巨獸龙"},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":true,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::345724138",
      "Source": "Mercenary Kaprosuchus",
      "Trans": {"SC":"佣兵-猪鳄","JA":"佣兵-猪鱷"},
