    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1400978866",
      "Source": "ECORE Tip- Submission Taming",
      "Trans": {"SC":"灭绝核心提示 — 顺从驯服","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3259178840",
      "Source": "Submission Taming<#RN#><#RN#>This is done with Beast Of Darkness, Ultimate Horvath,Silitha and Bokito.<#RN#><#RN#>You need to have scroll of truce active before the second Beast Of Darkness shows up or when it shows up<#RN#><#RN#>A HUD message will be displayed saying ‘Keep proving your worth to the Beast of Darkness’<#RN#><#RN#>You then engage it to get it as low health as possible.<#RN#><#RN#>This goes for the same as Ultimates but instead of the Scroll, you need the respected Vials that drop from the respected dino boss.<#RN#>For example Ultimate Bokito you need to get one from Megapithecus, much like the Improved saddle its a low chance to drop.<#RN#><#RN#>All participants of the taming process have to have it active<#RN#><#RN#>Otherwise it doesn’t register your trying to tame it.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"顺从驯服<#RN#><#RN#>该驯服方式适用于黑暗之魂、终极霍瓦斯、西莉萨与博基托。.<#RN#><#RN#>在第二只黑暗之魂出现前或出现时，必须提前开启停战卷轴<#RN#><#RN#>届时界面会弹出提示文字：继续向黑暗之魂证明你的实力<#RN#><#RN#>随后上前攻击它，将其血量压制至极低状态即可.<#RN#><#RN#>终极类生物驯服逻辑同理，区别是无需卷轴，要使用对应恐龙 BOSS 掉落的专属药剂.<#RN#>例如驯服终极博基托，需要从巨猿 BOSS 处获取对应药剂，和精良鞍具一样，掉落概率较低.<#RN#><#RN#>参与此次驯服的所有玩家都必须开启对应道具<#RN#><#RN#>否则系统无法判定你正在进行驯服操作.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3982834347",
      "Source": "ECORE Page- Stellar Dino Tier",
      "Trans": {"SC":"灭绝核心页面 - 星耀生物级","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3813410131",
      "Source": "Stellar Dino's are the weakest in nature, but they have the ability to breed unlike the other primordials.<#RN#>You unlock engram of the saddle by killing on.<#RN#>To obtain one lower female one's health to drop egg. <#RN#><#RN#>There are: Stellar Giga-Stellar Fasola-Stellar Thyla-Stellar Spino",
      "Trans": {"SC":"星耀系恐龙本身实力最弱，但和其他远古生物不同，它们可以繁殖.<#RN#>击杀该类恐龙即可解锁对应鞍具印痕技能.<#RN#>想要获取恐龙蛋，只需压低雌性个体血量使其产卵. <#RN#><#RN#>种类包含：星耀南巨、星耀法索拉鳄、星耀袋狮、星耀棘背龙","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3309458612",
      "Source": "ECORE Page- Supreme Dino Tier",
      "Trans": {"SC":"灭绝核心页面 - 至高生物阶级","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1780263798",
      "Source": "Supremes:<#RN#>In order to Get these Blood Thirsy Primordial Dinos,You must defeat one first.<#RN#>Once you do not only do you unlock the engrams associated with it.<#RN#>It will give you the Supreme Soul that corresponds with the Supreme trying to get.<#RN#>Then check the Inventory of the respected Alpha dinos.<#RN#>So far the Supremes you can get. Supreme Reaper,Supreme Rex, Supreme Trike, Supreme Deinotherium<#RN#>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"至高级生物:<#RN#>想要获得这些嗜血远古恐龙，必须先将其击杀.<#RN#>击杀后不仅能解锁其对应印痕技能.<#RN#>还会掉落对应种类的至高之魂.<#RN#>之后前往对应精英生物的物品栏查看即可.<#RN#>目前可获取的至高恐龙：至高死神、至高霸王龙、至高三角龙、至高恐象<#RN#>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2439732095",
      "Source": "ECORE Page- Pygmys Tier",
      "Trans": {"SC":"灭绝核心页面 - 侏儒阶级","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4204398741",
      "Source": "Pygyms: Try to kill all Pygmys when you see them, as they drop really good resources. <#RN#>You will need a speedy dino, strong one or Alpha to catch up to them so can kill them.<#RN#>They run, do not fight back <#RN#><#RN#>White Pygmys- Drops all artifacts needed for the mod if cant find it<#RN#>Red Pygmys- Drops Gems for the mod,Prime Resources.<#RN#>Blue Pygmys- Drops Armor for player with higher quailty.<#RN#>Yellow Pygmys- Drops Saddles for Vanilla and Alpha Dinos<#RN#>Green Pygmys- Drops genuine supplies could be nice to grab,oil,sap,metal etc<#RN#>Purple Pygyms- Drops Weapons.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"侏儒生物：遇见侏儒生物尽量击杀，它们能掉落优质物资. <#RN#>需要速度快、战力高的恐龙或是首领级生物才能追上并击杀它们.<#RN#>它们只会逃跑，不会主动反击 <#RN#><#RN#>白色跳鼠：可掉落模组所需全部神器，缺道具可刷它<#RN#>红色跳鼠：掉落模组宝石与优质稀有材料.<#RN#>蓝色跳鼠：掉落高品质玩家穿戴护甲.<#RN#> 黄色跳鼠：掉落原版恐龙与精英级恐龙鞍具<#RN#>绿色跳鼠：掉落实用基础物资，如石油、树脂、金属等<#RN#>紫色跳鼠：掉落各类武器.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3974745842",
      "Source": "ECORE Page- Scion Tier",
      "Trans": {"SC":"灭绝核心页面 - 后裔阶级","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2236044925",
      "Source": "Scions: Scions are pretty much baby Deities, Except they’re way easier. <#RN#>When you are able to,fight scions to not only test how you are progression wise. <#RN#>But will also be dropping diamonds an Cosmic Flowers that are needed diamonds for mid-end game.<#RN#><#RN#>I would start trying to face them once you have Alphas on the level of Alpha Superior Kibble. <#RN#>It would help if have Alpha Saddles with higher armor but its not needed.<#RN#><#RN#>Scions are the heralds of the Guardian Golem Deitys; with unique elemental effects. <#RN#>Fire..well you can take a wild guess. <#RN#>Nature is torpor, <#RN#>Winter stamina draining/slowing you down. <#RN#>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"后裔生物：后裔相当于幼年神祇，难度要低得多. <#RN#>实力足够后挑战后裔，既能检验自身发育进度. <#RN#>还能掉落中后期必备的钻石与宇宙之花.<#RN#><#RN#>拥有顶级精英级的精英恐龙后，就可以尝试挑战它们. <#RN#>配备高防御精英鞍具会更轻松，但并非必备.<#RN#><#RN#>后裔是守护神祇的先锋，拥有专属元素特效. <#RN#>火焰属性效果不言而喻. <#RN#>自然属性会造成眩晕效果, <#RN#>寒冰属性会削减耐力并减缓移速. <#RN#>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1893099057",
      "Source": "ECORE Page- Skeletal Tier",
      "Trans": {"SC":"灭绝核心页面 - 骨架阶级","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1264283072",
      "Source": "Skeletal: Facing these undead creatures is good opportunity to test the wits an strength about you. <#RN#>Torpor is going to be the biggest issue until you get detox’s, after that they are just good dino’s to face due to the loot they give. <#RN#>The harder Skeletal’s will do more damage, like Rex for Example. <#RN#>When should you face them? Could try with higher vanilla dinos if have good saddle or dino is strong.<#RN#>But would advise until have a Alpha Dino.<#RN#><#RN#>Nightmare Skeletal dinos are stronger variants of normal skeletal dinos.<#RN#>They do double torpor an damage. <#RN#>But these are good to try to take on due to the fact they are like Pygmys but better loot then the Pygmys.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"骨架生物：迎战这些亡灵生物，是考验自身智慧与实力的绝佳机会. <#RN#>在获得解毒道具前，眩晕效果是最大难题，集齐道具后便可轻松挑战，其掉落物资十分丰厚. <#RN#>高阶骨架生物伤害更高，例如骨架霸王龙. <#RN#>何时适合挑战？拥有强力原版恐龙且配备优质鞍具即可尝试.<#RN#>但更建议拥有精英恐龙后再来挑战.<#RN#><#RN#>噩梦骨架恐龙是普通骨架恐龙的强化形态.<#RN#>它们造成的眩晕值与伤害均为双倍. <#RN#>这类生物值得挑战，机制类似侏儒生物，且掉落物品品质远超侏儒生物.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::227768886",
      "Source": "ECORE Page- Tribemen Tier",
      "Trans": {"SC":"灭绝核心页面 - 部落阶级","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3359046765",
      "Source": "Tribesmen: Old vets are familiar with this, but for new players listen up.<#RN#>There are human NPC’s added to give just that itch of PVP out of that system of yours. <#RN#>Upon the color of the tribes, the difficulty of how hard they are increases and the tames they have are on the higher ranks.<#RN#>Yes most of the Tribesmen you can have them as a trusty ally. <#RN#>They are tameable from KO and needed - Or Alpha meat jerky.<#RN#>They will keep their tames when you have them in your tribe.<#RN#><#RN#>Killing the tribesmen is more rewarding, as it will not only give you really good loot. <#RN#>But also will give you respected kibble to match the difficulty of the tribemen. <#RN#>You kill yellow tribemen,expect to get basic kibble.<#RN#>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"部落级：老玩家对此早已熟知，新玩家请仔细了解.<#RN#>模组新增了人类 NPC，能带来类似玩家对战的对抗乐趣. <#RN#>部落战士按颜色划分强度，颜色越高级别越高，所驯养的生物品级也越高.<#RN#>大部分部落战士都可以收服成为可靠盟友. <#RN#>将其击晕即可驯服，驯服所需道具为精英肉干.<#RN#>收服至部落后，他们原本驯养的生物也会一同保留.<#RN#><#RN#>击杀部落战士收益更高，不仅能获取丰厚物资. <#RN#>还能掉落对应其难度等级的饲料. <#RN#>击杀黄色部落战士，可获得基础饲料.<#RN#>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1384637934",
      "Source": "ECORE Page- Vanilla Ecore Tier",
      "Trans": {"SC":"灭绝核心页面 - 原版核心阶级","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::820692870",
      "Source": "Vanilla Core: These are dinos that do not belong in a category. As they are more tied to Vanilla Ark<#RN#><#RN#>Dodorexy's- Elemental Dodorexys that share similar abilites to Wyverns, standard KO<#RN#>Phoneix- These spawn in the daytime,they are tamed the usual way like vanilla. They have a new fire spin attack, breedable.<#RN#>Wyverns- When you find a female, lower its health it will drop a egg.<#RN#>Golden Dodo- A very rare Golden Dodo that will produce alot of goodies.<#RN#>Reaper- Tamed usual way, you will know its from the mod when in the inventory see engram in it",
      "Trans": {"SC":"原版核心：这类恐龙无专属品级分类，更贴合方舟原版设定<#RN#><#RN#>渡渡飞龙：拥有元素属性，技能与飞龙相近，常规击晕驯服<#RN#>凤凰：仅白天刷新，沿用原版驯服方式，新增火焰旋击技能，可繁殖.<#RN#>飞龙：找到雌性个体后压低血量即可产下龙蛋.<#RN#>黄金嘟嘟鸟：极为稀有，可产出大量优质物资.<#RN#>死神：原版方式驯服，物品栏内可见专属印痕技能即可区分模组版本","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1642990755",
      "Source": "ECORE Tip- For Knocking things out",
      "Trans": {"SC":"灭绝核心提示 - 击晕实用技巧","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1217247203",
      "Source": "There are several ways to get better methods of Tranq'ing in the mod. <#RN#><#RN#>Besides the normal ways which would,will carry you in the mod to a point.<#RN#>In no particular order there is<#RN#><#RN#>Alpha Dilo with its bite<#RN#>Prime Titanboa with its bite<#RN#>Alpha Scorpion with its attacks<#RN#>Tranq Compound Arrow, it 3 Times more effective then a dart.<#RN#>Powerful Tranq Arrow, these are needed to knock out the Boss's. <#RN#>Ive never needed more then 20 to knock out a Boos.<#RN#>Broodmother will be the best afterwards.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"模组内有多种高效击晕手段. <#RN#><#RN#>常规击晕方式前期足以够用.<#RN#>以下不分先后<#RN#><#RN#>精英双脊龙撕咬<#RN#>究极泰坦巨蟒撕咬<#RN#>精英肺蝎攻击<#RN#>复合麻醉箭，效果是麻醉镖的三倍.<#RN#>强效麻醉箭，专门用于击晕各类 BOSS. <#RN#>击晕 BOSS 一般用不到二十支.<#RN#>育母蜘蛛是后期最优击晕选择.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3621707831",
      "Source": "Extinction Core Grinder",
      "Trans": {"SC":"灭绝核心研磨机","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4016135471",
      "Source": "Grind up crafted items, certain resources and create other gems",
      "Trans": {"SC":"可研磨成品道具与各类物资，合成各类宝石","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2877653367",
      "Source": "Place materials along with blueprints in this to Unrivalled Items an Armor Obtainable. Requires Element to Run",
      "Trans": {"SC":"放入材料与蓝图即可制作极品装备护甲，运行需消耗元素","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1709537636",
      "Source": "TheOneBeing Trophy",
      "Trans": {"SC":"永恒真神战利品","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2600528096",
      "Source": "Place it on a trophy wall-mount, and keep it safe to use as an invaluable token of your prowess...you have defeated TheOneBeing at 10% of its power. Be proud survivor",
      "Trans": {"SC":"       将其放置于奖杯壁挂架妥善保存，以此彰显你的强大实力。你已击败仅发挥一成实力的永恒真神，幸存者，为此自豪吧    翻译格式为原文在前译文在后，用|分割。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3245908652",
      "Source": "A powerful melee weapon tipped with metal that applies torpor.  Unlike the Spear, it cannot be thrown. ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"强力近战金属尖刺武器，可造成眩晕效果，无法像长矛一样投掷","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1703530897",
      "Source": "Tranq Spear",
      "Trans": {"SC":"麻醉长矛","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1756719984",
      "Source": "An easily made melee weapon that can also be thrown.  Has a chance to break when used. Applies some torpor but does less damage",
      "Trans": {"SC":"制作简易的近战武器，亦可投掷，使用时有概率损坏，可造成少量眩晕，伤害偏低","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1329007504",
      "Source": "Equip an Alpha Ankylo with this to ride it an to enable the empowered bonus",
      "Trans": {"SC":"装备到精英甲龙上以骑乘并激活强化加成","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3806205574",
      "Source": "Alpha MegaRaptor Saddle",
      "Trans": {"SC":"精英大盗龙鞍","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1656573311",
