      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2450426592",
      "Source": "-This will bring upon StrongHeart, The Courage Deity harmonizing ultimate will within every living thing (USE IN YOUR INVENTORY.)  <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Defeating will unlock Azure Amulet.</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用此物可召唤勇气之神强心，凝聚万物极致意志（在物品栏内使用）。<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">将其击败可解锁天青护符</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::461488321",
      "Source": "This will bring upon Tanjiro, The Transcedence Deity harmonizing ultimate evloution, to get stronger, an being the best that you can acheive to be (USE IN YOUR INVENTORY) <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Defeating will unlock Azure Amulet.</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用此物可召唤超越之神炭治郎，融汇极致蜕变之力，助力自身突破变强（在物品栏内使用）。<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">将其击败可解锁天青护符 </>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2454584324",
      "Source": "This will bring upon Tartarus, The Justice Deity harmonizing ultimate justice,vengence, an redemption within every living thing (USE IN YOUR INVENTORY) <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Defeating will unlock Azure Amulet.</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用此物可召唤正义之神塔洛斯，承载世间极致正义、复仇与救赎之力（在物品栏内使用）。<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">将其击败可解锁天青护符 </>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
