      "Source": "Frequent Questions",
      "Trans": {"SC":"常见问题","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4078232767",
      "Source": "Difficulty Settings]The level, meaning actual dino max difficulty should work on any difficulty as of now. it's optimized for Ark’s normal difficulty, you won't have to increase the dino level if you so wish. How do you increase the levels? Here are some examples below",
      "Trans": {"SC":"难度设置：当前生物等级上限适配所有游戏难度. 已针对方舟默认难度优化，无需手动调高恐龙等级. 想要提升等级？下方附上设置示例","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
