    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::490808474",
      "Source": "Extinction Core Ascended can be a brutal mod when played alone or with friendsfriends would make it easier! Regardless, once you get the hang of itExtinction Core Ascended can be a rewarding an fun. ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"飞升灭绝核心模组单人游玩难度极高，联机游玩会轻松很多！ 但熟练上手后，游玩体验极佳且乐趣十足. ","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
