    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::301439349",
      "Source": "Tribesmen: Old legacy players are familiar with this, but for new players listen up. There are human NPC’s added to give just that itch of PVP out of that system of yours. Upon the color of the tribesThe difficulty of how hard they are increases Along the tames they have are on the higher ranks.Yes most of the Tribesmen you can have them as a trusty ally.Tribesmen can do vareity of different other attacks,throw bolas,grenades etc.Alpha tribesmen induce bleed an if they throw a bola,can chain bola even Alpha Rex's",
      "Trans": {"SC":"部落族人：老玩家熟知该设定，新玩家须知；模组新增人类 NPC，增添对战乐趣；部落阵营颜色决定其强度，麾下驯养生物品级也随之提升；多数部落族人可收服成为可靠盟友，能够投掷套索、手雷等多种道具；精英部落族人可造成流血效果，投掷套索甚至能束缚精英霸王龙","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
