    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3712026371",
      "Source": "The OG Bosses: Arks bosses are tameable. <#RN#>Which is unlocked when you kill the corresponding boss an unlocking it’s matrix. <#RN#>You don't necessarily NEED them to take on Scions. <#RN#>BUT mandatory when battling the Guardian Golem Deities which is the next target should go for after obtaining a boss. <#RN#>You will be needing the Poison Compound Bow Arrow’s to knock them out.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"原版BOSS：方舟原生BOSS均可驯服. <#RN#>击杀对应BOSS即可解锁其图鉴阵列后即可开启驯服权限. <#RN#>挑战后裔级生物并非必须拥有这类 BOSS. <#RN#>但挑战守护神祇必须拥有，收服BOSS后便可挑战该目标. <#RN#>需使用剧毒复合弓箭矢将其击晕驯服.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2077485797",
      "Source": "Alpha Acro Saddle",
      "Trans": {"SC":"精英高棘龙鞍","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1846928615",
      "Source": "Equip an Alpha Acrocanthosaurus with this to ride it an to enable the empowered bonus",
      "Trans": {"SC":"装备到精英高棘龙上以骑乘并激活强化加成","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4191366445",
      "Source": "Fertilized Alpha Acrocanthosaurus Egg",
      "Trans": {"SC":"受精的精英高棘龙蛋","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    }
